Restores #1009: `fslc html` discards the verification status, bypasses the
report-verification-error gate, and returns `generated_content_result`'s exit 0
after successful rendering. A process-exit-only gate sees a pass over a
`violated` baseline. Remove the early error gate as well as the final status
fold so the discarded status has no remaining use on the shared timing path.

